@host = http://localhost:5200

### Register a customer (public)
POST {{host}}/api/Customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "María",
  "lastName": "López",
  "birthDate": "1992-07-15",
  "documentNumber": "001-150792-0003C",
  "gender": "F",
  "monthlyIncome": 2200,
  "password": "Banking123!"
}

### Log in as the seeded customer Ana (account 1000000001). Run this first: the requests below reuse the token.
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "001-120490-0001A",
  "password": "Banking123!"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Log in as Luis (account 1000000002) to try the 403 responses
# @name loginLuis
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "001-031185-0002B",
  "password": "Banking123!"
}

###
@luisToken = {{loginLuis.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Wrong password: 401 problem
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "001-120490-0001A",
  "password": "nope"
}

### Get my own customer record
GET {{host}}/api/Customer/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List my accounts, oldest first (Luis' token would get a 403)
GET {{host}}/api/Customer/1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Open another account for myself (customerId must be mine)
POST {{host}}/api/BankAccount
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "initialDeposit": 100
}

### Seeded account: details and balance
GET {{host}}/api/BankAccount/1000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/BankAccount/1000000001/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deposit
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction/Deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "accountNumber": "1000000001",
  "amount": 50.25
}

### Deposit with an Idempotency-Key: run it twice. The second run replays the first response
### (same transactionId, Idempotent-Replayed: true) and the balance moves only once.
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction/Deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: deposit-2026-10-18-0001

{
  "accountNumber": "1000000001",
  "amount": 10
}

### Same key, different amount: 422 problem with code IdempotencyKeyReused (nothing is applied)
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction/Deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: deposit-2026-10-18-0001

{
  "accountNumber": "1000000001",
  "amount": 11
}

### Withdrawal
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction/Withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "accountNumber": "1000000001",
  "amount": 20
}

### Apply interest
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction/Apply-Interest
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "accountNumber": "1000000001"
}

### Withdrawal above the balance, error in Spanish (Accept-Language: en for English)
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction/Withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "accountNumber": "1000000001",
  "amount": 100000
}

### Unknown customer, error in Spanish
GET {{host}}/api/Customer/999999
Accept-Language: es-NI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transfer from Ana's account to Luis' account
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction/Transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "sourceAccountNumber": "1000000001",
  "destinationAccountNumber": "1000000002",
  "amount": 25
}

### Transfer to the same account: 400 problem with code SameAccountTransfer
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction/Transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "sourceAccountNumber": "1000000001",
  "destinationAccountNumber": "1000000001",
  "amount": 25
}

### Ledger summary
GET {{host}}/api/Transaction/1000000001/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ledger summary, second page of two transactions
GET {{host}}/api/Transaction/1000000001/summary?page=2&pageSize=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No token: 401 problem with WWW-Authenticate
GET {{host}}/api/BankAccount/1000000001/balance

### Luis reading Ana's account: 403 problem
GET {{host}}/api/BankAccount/1000000001/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{luisToken}}

### Health (public): every check, including the database, as JSON
GET {{host}}/health

### Liveness (public): the process answers; no checks run
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness (public): 200 while the database answers SELECT 1, 503 otherwise
GET {{host}}/health/ready
